<title>BELGIUM: Belgian company investment rose 0.1 pct in Sept.</title>
<headline>Belgian company investment rose 0.1 pct in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's National Statistics Institute (NSI) released the following data on corporate investment, calculated from VAT returns, for September -</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Sept 1996  Aug 1996  Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1985)  200.2	171.4     200.0</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	 +0.1	 +1.5</p>
<p>    COMPANY INVESTMENT     Jan-Sept 1996   Jan-Aug 1996</p>
<p>    Yr/yr pct change	 +4.8		+6.0</p>
<p>NOTE - non-industrial investments rose 1.2 percent in the first nine months, industrial investments rose 10.6 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
